; Prototype Zero — Gate C inert target fixture.
;
; A practice post. NOT a Graveblade: no AI, no attack, no Life, no death, no XP,
; no loot. It exists only so Gate C can prove acquisition, approach, the release
; arc, obstruction, and controller priority before Gate D builds an enemy.
;
; It sits on the "target" physics layer alone, so it neither collides with the
; player nor appears in the navigation bake, and therefore cannot change any
; Gate B locomotion result.

